{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受描写不如Y细腻具体，音乐声部、音色、旋律变化与情绪的对应也不够充分，且缺少到时出现的节奏控制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮和感受分时出现，确实更利于快速扫屏，感受描写也更丰富，尤其能把音乐变化转化成具体的身体体验。但X的叙述更完整地交代了人物每次情绪变化的原因、顾虑和心理转折，前后因果也更连贯；Y有些地方压缩过度，甚至改变了意思，例如S12的「只想让对方安心」和S13的「心愿终于说出口」。作为没有读过原文、边听边看的普通观众，我更看重能否真正理解这个人的心路历程，因此选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "62e6d55d-c157-41dc-892a-364a2f96b9e8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T224239782138Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.296, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:44:03.088275+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ced2ddf897c114eb508bff98f7a1ac954f707a2d6cfffc76dc3151cd64746c70", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_